","nm":"전진","cls":"물가시티 관장","tr":"leader_volkner","ow":"volkner","music":"gymBattle","ln":["…요즘 배틀이 시시했거든. 네 체육관은 나를 짜릿하게 해 줄까?","…오랜만에 짜릿했다. 고맙다.","아직 내 전기를 감당하긴 이르군."],"st":[[[135,46,["thunderwave","chargebeam","irontail","quickattack"]],[26,46,["chargebeam","focusblast","signalbeam","quickattack"]],[405,48,["icefang","thunderfang","crunch","firefang"]],[466,50,["thunderpunch","firepunch","quickattack","gigaimpact"]]],[[135,61,["pinmissile","chargebeam","doublekick","quickattack"]],[26,61,["chargebeam","brickbreak","thunderwave","lightscreen"]],[405,62,["icefang","thunderfang","crunch","firefang"]],[171,63,["discharge","signalbeam","surf","icebeam"]],[466,65,["thunderpunch","firepunch","brickbreak","gigaimpact"]]]]},{"id":"aaron","nm":"충호","cls":"사천왕","tr":"elite_four_aaron","ow":"aaron","music":"champ","ln":["사천왕 충호! 벌레 포켓몬의 아름다움과 강함을 보여 주지!","…졌다. 내 벌레 포켓몬들, 미안해.","벌레 포켓몬은 약하지 않아!"],"st":[[[469,49,["airslash","bugbuzz","uturn","doubleteam"]],[212,49,["ironhead","xscissor","nightslash","quickattack"]],[416,50,["attackorder","defendorder","powergem"]],[214,51,["megahorn","closecombat","nightslash","stoneedge"]],[452,53,["xscissor","crosspoison","icefang","aerialace"]]],[[469,65,["airslash","bugbuzz","uturn","doubleteam"]],[212,65,["ironhead","xscissor","nightslash","quickattack"]],[416,66,["attackorder","defendorder","powergem"]],[214,67,["megahorn","closecombat","nightslash","stoneedge"]],[452,69,["xscissor","crosspoison","icefang","aerialace"]]]]},{"id":"bertha","nm":"들국화","cls":"사천왕","tr":"elite_four_bertha","ow":"bertha","music":"champ","ln":["어머, 젊은 관장님이네. 이 할미랑 한판 하겠누?","호호호, 정말 잘 키웠구나.","아직 땅이 단단하지 않구나."],"st":[[[340,50,["earthpower","aquatail","zenheadbutt","sandstorm"]],[472,53,["earthquake","icefang","firefang","thunderfang"]],[450,52,["earthquake","stoneedge","crunch","yawn"]],[76,52,["earthquake","firepunch","thunderpunch","sandstorm"]],[464,55,["earthquake","rockwrecker","megahorn","avalanche"]]],[[340,66,["earthpower","aquatail","zenheadbutt","sandstorm"]],[472,69,["earthquake","icefang","firefang","thunderfang"]],[450,68,["earthquake","stoneedge","crunch","yawn"]],[76,68,["earthquake","firepunch","thunderpunch","sandstorm"]],[464,71,["earthquake","rockwrecker","megahorn","avalanche"]]]]},{"id":"flint","nm":"대엽","cls":"사천왕","tr":"elite_four_flint","ow":"flint","music":"champ","ln":["사천왕 대엽이다! 내 불꽃만큼 뜨거운 배틀을 하자고!","이야… 완전히 불타 버렸어!","이 열기, 느껴지냐!"],"st":[[[229,52,["flamethrower","sludgebomb","darkpulse","sunnyday"]],[136,55,["overheat","gigaimpact","quickattack","willowisp"]],[78,53,["flareblitz","solarbeam","bounce","sunnyday"]],[392,55,["flareblitz","thunderpunch","machpunch","earthquake"]],[467,57,["flamethrower","thunderbolt","solarbeam","hyperbeam"]]],[[229,68,["flamethrower","sludgebomb","darkpulse","sunnyday"]],[136,71,["overheat","gigaimpact","quickattack","willowisp"]],[78,69,["flareblitz","solarbeam","bounce","sunnyday"]],[392,71,["flareblitz","thunderpunch","machpunch","earthquake"]],[467,73,["flamethrower","thunderbolt","solarbeam","hyperbeam"]]]]},{"id":"lucian","nm":"오엽","cls":"사천왕","tr":"elite_four_lucian","ow":"lucian","music":"champ","ln":["사천왕 오엽입니다. 책을 덮고, 승부에 집중하지요.","…훌륭합니다. 정말 좋은 배틀이었어요.","결말은 예상대로군요."],"st":[[[122,53,["psychic","thunderbolt","reflect","lightscreen"]],[196,55,["psychic","shadowball","quickattack","signalbeam"]],[437,54,["psychic","gyroball","earthquake","calmmind"]],[65,56,["psychic","energyball","focusblast","recover"]],[475,59,["drainpunch","psychocut","leafblade","stoneedge"]]],[[122,69,["psychic","thunderbolt","reflect","lightscreen"]],[196,71,["psychic","shadowball","quickattack","signalbeam"]],[437,70,["psychic","gyroball","earthquake","calmmind"]],[65,72,["psychic","energyball","focusblast","recover"]],[475,75,["drainpunch","psychocut","leafblade","stoneedge"]]]]},{"id":"cynthia","nm":"난천","cls":"챔피언","tr":"champion_cynthia","ow":"cynthia","music":"champ","ln":["안녕, 관장님. 네 체육관 이야기를 듣고 왔어. 챔피언으로서 진지하게 상대할게.","…멋진 배틀이었어. 네 포켓몬을 향한 마음이 느껴져.","포켓몬과 함께라면 더 강해질 수 있을 거야."],"s